  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_01",
      "hash64": "EA9DF8A57A95E017",
      "text": "Whoa, whoa! Hold it, you![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_01",
      "hash64": "C01FE0B0C3FE6700",
      "text": "Up ahead’s the base of operations for Team\\nStar’s Dark crew.\\c\\nYou may know us as the Segin Squad![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_02",
      "hash64": "EA9DF9A57A95E1CA",
      "text": "Yup! And we don’t take too kindly to random\\nkids sniffing around our turf.[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_02",
      "hash64": "C01FE3B0C3FE6C19",
      "text": "Sorry, but if you don’t turn yourself around here,\\namig[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, we’ll have to send you packing![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_03",
      "hash64": "EA9DFAA57A95E37D",
      "text": "Wait, hold up...\\c\\nJust going on a hunch here, but...are you that\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)] kid?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_04",
      "hash64": "EA9DF3A57A95D798",
      "text": "Y’know, that piece of work we’re out to get for\\ndeclaring war on Team Star?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "8681C990FFF42607",
      "text": "Maybe I am",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8681CA90FFF427BA",
      "text": "You’ve got it all wrong!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_03",
      "hash64": "C01FE2B0C3FE6A66",
      "text": "“Maybe I am,” [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]she says. Cool as a cucumber!\\nHonesty’s not always the best policy, you know...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_04",
      "hash64": "C01FE5B0C3FE6F7F",
      "text": "Talk about suspicious! That’s exactly what\\nsomeone trying to slip under the radar would say![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "EA9DF4A57A95D94B",
      "text": "Ugh, you know what? Doesn’t matter who you\\nare. You’re not gettin’ through.\\c\\nBuzz off or get thrashed by me in battle, kid.\\nWhat’ll it be?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "8681CB90FFF4296D",
      "text": "I’ll take you on!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "8681C490FFF41D88",
      "text": "I’ll get out of your hair...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_05",
      "hash64": "C01FE4B0C3FE6DCC",
      "text": "Have a nice walk back, then! Hasta la vistar! ☆[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_06",
      "hash64": "EA9DF5A57A95DAFE",
      "text": "Graaah! Sassy kids like you are the worst!\\nThat’s it—prepare to get stomped into the dirt![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_07",
      "hash64": "EA9DF6A57A95DCB1",
      "text": "Graaah! How the heck could I lose?![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_08",
      "hash64": "EA9DEFA57A95D0CC",
      "text": "Well, whatever, it’s your problem now! Finish up\\nhere for me, would ya, bud?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_09",
      "hash64": "EA9DF0A57A95D27F",
      "text": "’K, thanks, hasta la vistaaaaaar! ☆[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_06",
      "hash64": "C01FE7B0C3FE72E5",
      "text": "Hasta...la...vi...star... ☆[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_07",
      "hash64": "C01FE6B0C3FE7132",
      "text": "... ... ...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_08",
      "hash64": "C01FE9B0C3FE764B",
      "text": "She’s new to the team, y’know. Might have to\\nhave a little chat with her about that attitude...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_09",
      "hash64": "C01FE8B0C3FE7498",
      "text": "*sigh*[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_10",
      "hash64": "C01C7BB0C3FB858A",
      "text": "Well, I’m gonna go into the base now and\\ngive the rest of the squad the heads-up.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_11",
      "hash64": "C01C7CB0C3FB873D",
      "text": "We’ll come at you full force if you set foot\\ninside, so you might wanna consider turning tail.\\r\\nEither way, best of luck to you, amig[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
